Subject: [PATCH 04/10] nvidia-x11: document driver updates and custom versions

Add pkgs/os-specific/linux/nvidia-x11/README.md covering how a driver is added or updated, how hashes are obtained and verified, and how to call mkDriver with a custom version. Point the hardware.nvidia.package option at it.

Assisted-by: omp:DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
---
 nixos/modules/hardware/video/nvidia.nix     |   3 +-
 pkgs/os-specific/linux/nvidia-x11/README.md | 144 ++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
