From 6be5611225e3ebc6d8d27d12525d4f4e7df5fef0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ccicnce113424 <ccicnce113424@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:30:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] linuxPackages.nvidiaPackages: move userspace utilities
 to a separate file

Assisted-by: Zed Agent:DeepSeek V4 Pro
---
 .../os-specific/linux/nvidia-x11/binaries.nix | 233 +++++++++++
 pkgs/os-specific/linux/nvidia-x11/default.nix |  20 +-
 .../linux/nvidia-x11/fabricmanager.nix        |  17 +-
 pkgs/os-specific/linux/nvidia-x11/generic.nix | 382 ++++++------------
